# CHECK.REQ - the requests REL/distchk.sh sends with INV /CMD to the
# sample data of each release disk.  Lines starting with # and empty lines
# are removed first.  ADMIN logs in with its first password, which must
# be changed, and is reset to it at the end, so that the data is left as
# it was found but for the audit rows; no answer depends on today's date.
HELLO CHECK
LOGIN ADMIN admin
PASSWD admin Check1986
LTYPE LIST
LOC LIST
LOC CONTENTS 0 ALL=1 TOP=1
USER GET READER
ITEM LIST
ASSY BOM 1
MAINT RECENT
LOAN OVERDUE ASOF=20261001
USER RESET ADMIN PASSWORD=admin
BYE
